Steps
Create the page "Student HQ".
Add the three databases above as inline databases.
Create the properties exactly as listed.
Add 5 example tasks and 2 goals (replace with your real ones).
Create the "Weekly Review" page using the template in 14_Weekly_Review_Checklist.md.
Click Share → Share to web and copy the link into your submission.
Use the link in the submission only after you have filled in real content.